<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cree Research rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cree Research rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said analyst Carlos Valeiras initiated coverage of Cree Research Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- also has venture rating on the stock for the short term &quot;due to the risks associated with the company's exposure to a single product (Blue LED) and a single customer for the majority of that product -- Siemens AG.&quot;</p>
<p>-- shares rose 3/4 to 13-5/8.</p>
</text>
